OL,3,GNEWSAChildren must 'learn to play' at
OL,4,Ahome - nursery boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren in Guernsey arrive at
OL,7,Fpre-school less capable than previous
OL,8,Fgenerations, according to a nursery
OL,9,Fboss.
OL,11,FKaryn Merrien, manager at Bright
OL,12,FBeginnings, said learning opportunities
OL,13,Fwere being missed and "children need to
OL,14,Flearn how to play".
OL,16,FMerrien said screens were "having a
OL,17,Fmassive impact", and the Covid pandemic
OL,18,Fhad brought other challenges.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
