OL,3,GNEWSAChildren must 'learn to play' at
OL,4,Ahome - nursery boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident for the Committee for
OL,7,FEducation, Sport and Culture, Paul
OL,8,FMontague has called for a "cultural
OL,9,Fchange" in how young children interact
OL,10,Fwith screens and their "social activity
OL,11,Finteraction with their peers".
